#describe what The guide is the left pane in Files, Flow and Macro, and the overview card is a compact bar that expands on demand.
#describe what With a guide the middle pane shows the step note only, with no REASON block.
#describe before Macro fell back to the changed-files list with reasons, and the full overview card sat above the guide.
#describe after Macro shows the bar and the guide steps; the card opens on its toggle and starts collapsed when the record has a guide.
#describe verified Typecheck, lint, the unit suite and the pull request review and graph e2e runs, with e2e checks that fail on the old behaviour.
