#reason src/renderer/lantern-prs.css Gives the compact bar and its toggle a layout of one or two lines, using the existing theme variables only.
#reason src/renderer/lib/lanternprpanel.ts Splits the overview card into an always-visible bar and a foldable rest, so a guided review does not open on a wall of text.
#reason src/renderer/lib/lanternreview.ts The step note already explains the file, so a second REASON block above the diff only repeats it.
#reason src/renderer/lib/lanternview.ts Hosts the guide in Macro as in Files and Flow, and keeps the card's open state per pull request so it does not depend on the view.
#reason test/e2e/app/renderer.ts Lets the harness show a guided pull request on the areas map and gives it a link, so Macro and View PR can be checked.
#reason test/e2e/pr-review-guide.spec.ts Pins the three behaviours asked for: guide in Macro, card collapsed with a guide and opened on click, no REASON above a step's diff.
#reason test/fixtures/graph/areas-pr-demo.ts Supplies a guided copy of the areas pull request, the only fixture where the Macro view is available.
#reason test/lantern-guide-view.test.ts Covers the card default and toggle and the reason rule at unit level, where the e2e run would be slow to diagnose.
